{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ABTRMz6aVGPDUB2afqKVWg","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Here are all the files you requested:\n\n## Cargo.toml (workspace root)\n```\n[workspace]\nmembers = [\n    \"crates/tank_core\",\n    \"crates/tank_data\",\n    \"crates/tank_tui\",\n    \"crates/tank_scenarios\",\n]\nresolver = \"2\"\n\n[workspace.package]\nedition = \"2021\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nlicense = \"MIT\"\n```\n\n## crates/tank_tui/Cargo.toml\n```\n[package]\nname = \"tank_tui\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nedition = \"2021\"\n\n[dependencies]\ncrossterm = \"0.27\"\nratatui = \"0.26\"\ntank_core = { path = \"../tank_core\" }\n```\n\n## crates/tank_tui/src/lib.rs\n```rust\nuse tank_core::{PlayerAction, TankSnapshot};\n\n#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq)]\npub enum Screen {\n    Overview,\n    Chemistry,\n    Biology,\n    Actions,\n    Log,\n}\n\n#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq)]\npub struct TuiApp {\n    pub active_screen: Screen,\n    pub snapshot: TankSnapshot,\n    pub pending_actions: Vec<PlayerAction>,\n}\n\nimpl TuiApp {\n    pub fn new(snapshot: TankSnapshot) -> Self {\n        Self {\n            active_screen: Screen::Overview,\n            snapshot,\n            pending_actions: Vec::new(),\n        }\n    }\n\n    pub fn queue_action(&mut self, action: PlayerAction) {\n        self.pending_actions.push(action);\n    }\n\n    pub fn update_snapshot(&mut self, snapshot: TankSnapshot) {\n        self.snapshot = snapshot;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## crates/tank_scenarios/Cargo.toml\n```\n[package]\nname = \"tank_scenarios\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nedition = \"2021\"\n\n[dependencies]\ntank_core = { path = \"../tank_core\" }\ntank_data = { path = \"../tank_data\" }\n```\n\n## crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs\n```rust\nuse tank_core::{SimMeta, SimSeed, TankState};\nuse tank_data::{load_scenario, ScenarioPreset};\n\npub fn default_scenario_ids() -> &'static [&'static str] {\n    tank_data::scenario_ids()\